    "summary": "**Divine Intervention** (Hallowed Martyrs) gets a new Effect. You may discard 1 to 3 Miracle dice; as the phase ends:\n\n- Put one **CHARACTER** model of your unit that was **destroyed** back on the battlefield, **unengaged**, as near as it can be to the spot where it was destroyed.\n- It no longer belongs to an **attached unit**, and the unit it now forms has a **starting strength** equal to 1.\n- Roll a D3 and add 1 per Miracle die discarded; the model has that many wounds left, up to its starting wounds.",
